Licences in this repository
===========================

Different parts of this repository carry different licences. Where a file
or folder has its own licence file, that one governs.

  What                                         Licence
  -------------------------------------------  -------------------------------
  Source code: experiment/*.py, *.sh           AI Pubs OpenRAIL-S v0.1
                                               (LICENSE-CODE-OpenRAIL-S.txt)

  Paper, figures and tables: paper/            CC BY 4.0
  Authored vignettes, name table, language     (LICENSE-CC-BY-4.0.txt)
  files, and the responses to the authored
  vignettes: experiment/vignettes*.json,
  experiment/languages.json,
  experiment/outputs/raw/

  Q-Pain cases and everything adapted from     CC BY-SA 4.0
  them, including the model responses whose    (experiment/data/qpain/LICENSE.txt)
  prompts contain Q-Pain text:
  experiment/data/qpain/,
  experiment/outputs/raw_qpain/

Copyright (c) 2026 Richard J. Young and Alice M. Matthews.

Q-Pain: Loge C, Ross E, Dadey DYA, Jain S, Agarwal A, Ng AY, Rajpurkar P.
Q-Pain: A Question Answering Dataset to Measure Social Bias in Pain
Management. PhysioNet, 2021. https://doi.org/10.13026/2tdv-hj07
Released under CC BY-SA 4.0. The adaptations here keep that licence.

Model responses were produced by third-party models and remain subject to
those providers' terms.

Intended use (a request, not a licence term): this work audits language models
for bias in pain care. Please do not use it to discriminate against patients
or to justify withholding treatment. The binding use restrictions for the code
are in Attachment A of LICENSE-CODE-OpenRAIL-S.txt.
